  "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept\nAsset type: ONE transparent production spritesheet containing exactly FIVE separate mobile board-game landmark illustrations. Wide horizontal canvas, target 2048 x 1024 pixels. Real alpha background. This is NEW artwork, never a collage of screenshot cards.\nLayout: exactly five independent objects, left-to-right in one horizontal row, one object per equal-width fifth of the sheet. Leave generous completely transparent gutters between every object. Keep all five objects fully inside their own fifth, no touching, overlapping, shared ground or bridges between objects. Align their footpoints to one baseline near the lower part of the canvas. Consistent camera, lighting and miniature world scale; their actual heights vary naturally. No extra objects or duplicate buildings.\nStyle shared across all five: polished toy-isometric 2D game illustrations with a friendly 3D-diorama impression, warm peach/red-brown/cream architecture, clean chunky forms, soft restrained surface shading, sea-green/gold landmark accents. Elevated three-quarter isometric camera looking down about 30 degrees. Same warm pastel seaside-city style across the entire sheet. Every sprite has opaque solid object surfaces and clean antialiased alpha edges.\nObjects in EXACT left-to-right order:\n1. A SMALL RED-AND-CREAM NEIGHBORHOOD SHOP: low compact single-story/two-level shop building, flat red-brown roof, cream trim, dark blue shop windows, a small red-and-cream awning and tiny entrance step. No signage or words.\n2. A BROWN THREE-STORY TOWNHOUSE: warm brick-brown/terracotta compact three-storey town building, cream projecting floor cornices, orderly dark teal windows, flat roof with small chimney. Clearly taller than the small shop, not a tower.\n3. A CLOCK-TOWER BUILDING: slender warm cream/ochre stepped tower building, small teal-blue clock face with simple hands and tick marks but NO numerals/letters, blocky gold/cream roof cap and small roof finial. Friendly miniature urban landmark.\n4. A CUTE GREEN STATUE OF LIBERTY ON ITS PEDESTAL: mint/sea-green robe, friendly simple face, crown with warm gold tips, raised torch and tablet, chunky reddish-brown/cream square pedestal. A complete small landmark object, not a floating icon. No moustache, top hat or branded mascot.\n5. A PROMENADE ENTRANCE WITH TWO LAMPPOSTS: a small pale stone/cream walkway entrance platform with two slender dark teal lampposts with warm pale-yellow lamp heads, low simple side rails, no building behind it. Slight isometric angle, compact and visibly distinct from the other four buildings.\nStrict exclusions: no card frame, card panel, white/cream background, tile background, three-dot indicators, stars, prices, currency, numbers, labels, letters, completion tick/checkmark, buttons, borders around sprites, UI, watermark. NO cast/drop/contact shadow outside the object's own silhouette; the rendering engine will add external shadows later. Internal form shading is allowed. No ground plane, scenery, street scene or sky. Outside each isolated object must be true empty alpha, not a checkerboard picture.",
